+|-----|-----|
+| `LAUNCH_STATUS.md` | Checklist snapshot |
+| `business/PRICING.md` | Service catalog alignment |
+| `business/OPERATOR_PLAYBOOK.md` | Daily operator rhythm |
+| `README.md` | Architecture + API index |
